eans they  cannot contact the virus and they're  people who believe that coffee 19 is not  for Africans they are saying that thing  is in fact this morning someone carried  me and he told me cover 19 is just for  rich people he doesn't believe in that  she says the only way to counter the  online misinformation is doing what she  is doing talking to people answering  their questions and trying to calm their  fears  Katherine SOI al Jazeera Nairobi Kenya
 

